      "message": "Note that there is little mongo specific error checking in this code, which should probably be added. \n\nParticularly, if a failover occurs, you may get a pymongo.errors.AutoReconnect error which you should use as a signal to retry the operation, which will cause the connection to be re-established. see http://api.mongodb.org/python/2.6/examples/high_availability.html for more details",
